    S2_M_short         6      8      16.1   2332   12   8   0    0    8  180
    A_M_d2             6      8      23.1   2515   12   8   0    0    8  180
    F_S_d10            1      3      43.5   1549    2   3   0    0    3   30
    G_L_d10           24     28      43.6   9691   42  28   0    0   28  720
    B_M_d10            6      8      44.6   2803   12   8   0    0    8  180
    X_M_extra          6      8      59.0   4388   12   8   0    0    8  180
    X_M_extra          6      8      60.4   5342   12   8   0    0    8  180
